A caption scope resets at a structural-only line

```
| a |

>

^ cap
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<p>^ cap</p>
```

```
>
^ cap
.
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<p>^ cap</p>
```

```
> q
>

^ cap
.
<figure>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
</figure>
```
